442
00:33:59,420 --> 00:34:06,300
The difference between Residence 1B and Residence 2 is approximately 4 feet on either side.

443
00:34:06,300 --> 00:34:11,180
So in Residence 1B, you are to maintain 10 feet on both sides of the home.

444
00:34:11,180 --> 00:34:16,660
In this case, in Residence 2, if it is to be approved, then that action would allow

445
00:34:16,660 --> 00:34:20,260
for a sum of 16 under Residence 2B.

446
00:34:20,260 --> 00:34:23,700
